# Base Caddyfile (local).
#
# caddy-docker-proxy merges this file with the config it generates from
# container labels. Per-project routing lives in each project's two labels;
# this file is the escape hatch for anything more complex (extra directives,
# snippets, odd sites). Keep it empty unless something truly needs it: site
# extras for this machine go in servers/local/caddy/Caddyfile (gitignored),
# which is appended to this file at build time.
